Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 15:03:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] UI/QRT: a QRT front-end, the browser and its helpers in
 one program

QRT (github.com/grinkodbogdan/qrt) runs Ladybird as a native program.
The front-end is one static executable: started as "ladybird <Helper>"
it runs that helper process (WebContent, RequestServer, ...), so
LibWeb, LibJS and ICU's data are on the disk once.  LibWebView launches
helpers that way on QRT.  QRT has no seccomp or Landlock: LibSandbox
leaves the seccomp code out and the helpers run unsandboxed.

For now the front-end runs headless (--headless=screenshot|text).
